      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "entry_s918_lev1_bin1",
          "description": "Surface layer, smallest section, a step with no nucleation anywhere in the column: model step 918, level 1, section 1 of 8. Reference: the em_scm_xy chem_opt = 170 column (data/eqwefic/chem170_scm, reference namelist unchanged), MOSAIC coagulation capture dumps/chem170_mosaic_coag (WRF fork earthsciml-instrumented-chem170 f311091e). Expected values are what coagsolv is handed in a REAL64 replay of mosaic_coag_1clm (kernels/mosaic_subproc_driver built with the coag entry hooks, fork 66a1b222, -fdefault-real-8; chem170_scm/coag_entry64/base_918.json) on these same inputs; tolerance rel 1e-09, the double-precision convention. Inputs are the bin's rows of the state entering coagulation (nucleation leaves this section untouched, checked) and the carried dry diagnostics. Plain path: neither the implausible-diagnostics recompute nor the empty-bin reset fires (pinned exactly), and the number is inside the section. The real32 in-model record at coagsolv's entry agrees with this replay to 2e-06 (4.7e-7 worst over the 7426 admissible cells of the 16 dumped steps); components the bin does not carry are pinned at exactly 0.",
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "r": [
              1.3968820024301554e-11,
              1.557805259383353e-18,
              9.337994372225908e-19,
              0.0,
              5.865676867833347e-12,
              2.7247195081816227e-22,
              7.227045028890907e-26,
              2.9337505597577376e-17,
              7.1418856885299e-14,
              3.5709404183625892e-12
            ],
            "mw": [
              96.06600189208984,
              62.00699996948242,
              35.45000076293945,
              60.00699996948242,
              18.04199981689453,
              22.989999771118164,
              40.08000183105469,
              1.0,
              250.0,
              1.0
            ],
            "dens": [
              1.7999999523162842,
              1.7999999523162842,
              2.200000047683716,
              2.5999999046325684,
              1.7999999523162842,
              2.200000047683716,
              2.5999999046325684,
              2.5999999046325684,
              1.0,
              1.7000000476837158
